  "details": "Hello, I'm creating this to propose an idea to you guys at VRChat. So since age verification came out and age gated instances, it has been a lot better, but what is the point of being age verified and not being able to do age verified things? VRChat you could make age gated worlds that only age verified people can only get into, and you could make the NSFW content like how they did with IMVU, where if you're not age verified, the other people won't be able to see the NSFW content, because honestly what's the point of having age verification if we adults can't use it to it's full extent. It makes things boring and repetitive and us adults need more than that so properly enjoy ourselves, so please make NSFW content possible with age verification, because every other game like VRChat does it, or come out with an adult pass or something, y'all can make it possible so please do this for us as we continue to support and fund VRChat. Thank you -xAlucardx",
